40	     Obtain a Stream of elements by visiting the root and every descendant of root and testing it against the evaluator.
41	
42	     @param evaluator Evaluator to test elements against
43	     @param root root of tree to descend
44	     @return A {@link Stream} of matches
45	     @since 1.19.1
46	     */
47	    public static Stream<Element> stream(Evaluator evaluator, Element root) {
48	        evaluator.reset();
